兩個人成直角坐法擠一張桌子，所以立刻要求要坐吧台，店內環境看起來也是偏老舊，很像平價台式拉麵店（一碗100多那種）。\n在工作區備餐的男性人員口罩都拉一半，不知道是什麼意思？\n總之整個用餐體驗非常失望，完全不會再回訪。",null,[0,97]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17697872423408668663/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dFeFJrWk5SbXhHVjIxb2JsVlVXbGRYYlc4ellVWkdlRlZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17697872423408668663/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dFeFJrWk5SbXhHVjIxb2JsVlVXbGRYYlc4ellVWkdlRlZyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17697872423408668663/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dFeFJrWk5SbXhHVjIxb2JsVlVXbGRYYlc4ellVWkdlRlZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17697872423408668663/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dFeFJrWk5SbXhHVjIxb2JsVlVXbGRYYlc4ellVWkdlRlZyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17697872423408668663/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dFeFJrWk5SbXhHVjIxb2JsVlVXbGRYYlc4ellVWkdlRlZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17697872423408668663/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvV0dFeFJrWk5SbXhHVjIxb2JsVlVXbGRYYlc4ellVWkdlRlZyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,25096,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGExRkZNRmxGV21oblVUWldXbW8zYUZGeFVrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x714f7d1ac24a7f2b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhXa1FFMFlFWmhnUTZWWmo3aFFxUkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGExRkZNRmxGV21oblVUWldXbW8zYUZGeFVrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGExRkZNRmxGV21oblVUWldXbW8zYUZGeFVrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poWGExRkZNRmxGV21oblVUWldXbW8zYUZGeFVrRRILMGRoZXVUNmlRRVEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qaFhhMUZGTUZsRldtaG5VVFpXV21vM2FGRnhVa0USCzBkaGV1VDZpUUVRIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARK39Kwhp9T3EqCzBk